 "purpose": "The geometry topics: area and perimeter on the cm2 grid, formulas (also circle and volume), angles, coordinates (the treasure map and the axes system) and scale.",
 "details": "Five Onderwerp subclasses under a base _Meetkunde. Rooster (the grid topic; not the same as kern/modellen.Rooster, which is the column-arithmetic grid) makes a Figuur of full and half squares (rectangle, L-shape, staircase, triangle) and asks area or perimeter; Formules calculates areas, perimeters and volumes with PI = 3,14 and shows the formula; Hoeken (angle kinds, degrees, the third angle of a triangle, adjacent angles); Coordinaten (a lettered grid or an axes system; read the point or place a cross); Schaal (map scale 1 : n, to real life, to the map, find the scale). Models are the dataclasses of kern/modellen.py (Figuur, Hoek, Kaart). The cheat sheets are two lists, one for area/formulas (shown in the menu under Meten) and one for angles, coordinates and scale. SOORTEN_HOEK and BIJVOEGLIJK are used for the angle kinds.",
 "module_docstring": "Meetkunde: oppervlakte en omtrek op het cm²-rooster, formules (ook cirkel en volume), hoeken, coördinaten (de schatkaart en het assenstelsel) en schaal.",
